From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] [unit] Test hanging up a dial the extension hasn't listed

With a call extension that lists a dial only when told to: a dial
nothing lists is hung up through the extension by hangup_active and
hangup_all, and by id over IRadio when the extension won't. Once
listed, whether before or after the dial completes, it's hung up once,
as any listed call. Releasing the held calls leaves it alone, and a
dial that failed leaves nothing behind to hang up.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 unit/unit_voicecall/unit_voicecall.c | 488 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 486 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

